## NLP Disaster Tweets Classification

This project studies binary text classification on short social media messages
related to disaster events.

### Methods
- Baseline model: TF-IDF + Logistic Regression
- Transformer model: DistilBERT fine-tuning using Hugging Face Transformers

### Highlights
- Built an end-to-end NLP pipeline from preprocessing to Kaggle submission
- Compared classical machine learning methods with transformer-based models
- Implemented training, validation (F1 score), and inference in a reproducible setup

### Tools
Python, PyTorch, Hugging Face Transformers, scikit-learn

### Notes
This project is adapted from a Kaggle dataset but focuses on model comparison
and pipeline design rather than leaderboard optimization.
